Recommends: libnotify-bin, xdg-utils
Suggests: fonts-noto-cjk
Description: I.K.E. - Internet Kontrol Experience, a private web browser
 A light, independent web browser focused on privacy: no telemetry, no
 accounts, no sponsored content, with ad blocking and fingerprinting
 protection built in. Pages are rendered by the system's Qt WebEngine; video
 and audio formats are the ones this system's engine can decode (I.K.E.
 ships no codec of its own).
